Source: fluxer
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://fluxer.app

Package: fluxer
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set mapped from the RPM spec's soname Requires (bundled
# Electron/Chromium runtime; t64 names target Debian Testing) plus
# libpipewire-0.3-0 for the bundled screen/audio-capture node modules
# (DT_NEEDED, voices/screenshare break without it).
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64, libatspi2.0-0, libcairo2, libcups2t64, libdbus-1-3, libexpat1, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libnotify4, libnspr4, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libpipewire-0.3-0, libudev1, libuuid1, libx11-6, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils
Description: Free and open source instant messaging and VoIP platform
 Fluxer is a free and open source instant messaging and VoIP platform
 built for friends, groups, and communities.
